{"answer":null,"company_tags":[],"concept_id":"prefix-cache-cross-request-privacy","content_sha256":"sha256:0a603b7a483ae44f964f7ad821ef3824590f2b5e6a3d2d7b0acc6bd4c3b534bf","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789955478.609636,"domain":"llm-inference","explanation":"前缀缓存命中/未命中带来 TTFT 差异,构成时序侧信道,可能泄露他人是否用过某前缀。缓解方式是按租户隔离缓存空间或对命中时序做处理,不能无差别跨租户共享。","id":"q-infer-mag2-prefix-cache-privacy-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"前缀命中会因是否复用已有块而产生可观测的延迟差异,攻击者可借时序侧信道推断他人是否发送过某段前缀;因此多租户下常按租户/密钥隔离缓存命名空间,避免跨租户共享"},{"id":"b","text":"共享前缀会把一个用户的采样温度强加给另一个用户"},{"id":"c","text":"前缀缓存会明文把 KV 返回给所有客户端"},{"id":"d","text":"它会导致所有请求返回相同输出"}],"prompt":"跨请求共享前缀 KV 缓存(automatic prefix caching)在多租户环境下需注意的安全/隐私风险是什么?","review_state":null,"schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"diagnosis","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"vLLM prefix caching","url":"https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/features/automatic_prefix_caching.html"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"SGLang RadixAttention","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.07104"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"kv-cache","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
